Z||000001||Oreif||04-16-2000||12:13 AM||||I checked out the MR2 Spyder on the net. To me it looks more like a Porsche Boxster. It's a 2345lbs car with a 1.8L 138hp 4cyl.<BR>Let me look at one of these in 14 years and see how well the ricer has held up. If GM kept making the Fiero it would probably be a 3800 for the regular coupes and a 3800SC for the GT's! But alas it was not so.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||doughboySE||04-16-2000||09:09 PM||||i have to say this and bash me if you may but a true fieroholic would not be swayed by anything.<BR>i wouldnt trade my car for all the money in the world and im dead serious, maybe im a freek but i find my fiero to be more unique then any car made right now and nothing gets me more excited then another fiero (in any shape)<BR>go ahead bash me dont really care im a proud fiero owner and nothing else turns my crank||||reg||1
